Packages:

Debian 13 (trixie), MySQL/MariaDB backend:

  pkg/build-deb.sh [output-dir]

  Builds mydns-mysql_<version>_amd64.deb in a debian:13 container (needs
  docker; DOCKER=podman works too) and writes it to ./dist. The packaging is
  in debian/; it can also be built directly on a Debian 13 host with
  "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b". After installing, see
  /usr/share/doc/mydns-mysql/README.Debian.

RedHat RPM (old, unmaintained): pkg/mydns-mysql.spec, pkg/mydns-postgres.spec.
